  "about.privacyTitle": "Privacy Policy",
  "about.privacyUpdated": "Last Updated: ",
  "about.privacy.s1": "1. Who We Are\nThis software \"My Schedule\" is developed by Kzure Lab. It is a completely offline local software, no login or network required.",
  "about.privacy.s2": "2. What We Collect\nWe do not collect any personal information. All data (courses, teachers, students, grades, etc.) is stored on your local device and will never be uploaded to any server.",
  "about.privacy.s3": "3. Data Storage\nAll data is stored as JSON files in the program directory (or %APPDATA%\\CourseApp). You can open, backup, copy, or delete these files at any time.",
  "about.privacy.s4": "4. Third-Party Services\nThis software does not use any third-party analytics, advertising, or statistics services. The news feature (optional) will access your specified RSS address, only to fetch news titles.",
  "about.privacy.s5": "5. Your Rights\nYou have full control over your data. Deleting the program directory will completely uninstall it without leaving any data.",
  "about.privacy.s6": "6. Contact Us\nFor privacy-related issues, please provide feedback via the project homepage.",
  "about.cookieTitle": "Cookie Statement",
  "about.cookie.s1": "1. What are Cookies\nCookies are small text files stored by websites in your browser to remember your preferences.",
  "about.cookie.s2": "2. This Software Does Not Use Cookies\n\"My Schedule\" is a desktop application, not a website. We do not use Cookies, LocalStorage, SessionStorage, or any browser storage technology at all.",
  "about.cookie.s3": "3. Local Configuration\nWe only save a config.json file in the program directory to remember your theme, language, window position, and other preferences. This file is completely local and will not be uploaded.",
  "about.cookie.s4": "4. How to Clear\nDelete the config.json file in the program directory to restore all settings to default.",

